I think it's  a good idea to clearly show what is official lojban, what are
spin-offs and proposals. In fact the majority of pages in tiki was about
changing or improving Lojban so it's actually a must. Of course one day I
might make LMW perfect in this regard but it may take 10 years. Are you
willing to wait? May be better to contribute yourself?

I imagine creating a bunch of pages with prefix: "Standard Lojban: " or
without any prefix. There should be other prefixes like "Proposal: " or
something. The structure of pages LMW needs to be carefully thought out
before applying it on live wiki.



